### ==========================================
### Ward 42 Fix-It Security Tests
### ==========================================


### 1. Invalid Login Attempt
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=WrongPassword


### ==========================================


### 2. Access Dashboard Without Login
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/dashboard


### ==========================================


### 3. Access Manage Reports Without Login
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/reports


### ==========================================


### 4. Access API Without Login
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/reports/summary


### ==========================================


### 5. Submit Report Without CSRF Token
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/report
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

category=Pothole&
street=Main Street&
description=Large pothole in the road&
reporter_name=Test User&
reporter_cell=0821234567


### ==========================================


### 6. Update Status Without CSRF Token
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/reports/1/update
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

status=Closed


### ==========================================


### 7. Invalid Report Status
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/reports/1/update
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

csrf_token=testtoken&
status=Hacked


### ==========================================


### 8. Invalid Reference Lookup
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/status
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

reference=INVALID-REFERENCE


### ==========================================


### 9. File Upload With Invalid Extension
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/report
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

photo=@malware.exe


### ==========================================


### 10. SQL Injection Login Test
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Username=' OR 1=1 --
&password=test


### ==========================================


### 11. XSS Test in Description Field
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/report
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

category=Other&
street=Main Street&
description=<script>alert('XSS')</script>&
reporter_name=Attacker&
reporter_cell=0821234567

### 12. Invalid Status Value

POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/reports/1/update
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

status=Bananas
